VestedOf_Options_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when the time is before the cliff
│   └── it should return 0
├── when the time is between the cliff and the end
│   └── it should return the shares vested by whole calendar months
├── when the time is at or after the end
│   └── it should return all the shares
└── given the grant was ended
    └── it should stop vesting at the end date
